s reduced by %second_attack_damage_penalty%%%."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Ember Spirit dashes around with blazing speed, attacking all enemies in the targeted area of effect, then returning to his start location. Deals bonus damage to heroes.", "notes_loc": ["Targets are determined when the spell is cast.", "A regular attack is done to each target every %attack_interval% seconds.", "Any attack modifier that Xin has (such as Critical Strike, Bash, Cleave, or Orb effects) will be applied normally on these attacks.", "Abilities and items can be used while Sleight of Fist is active."], "facets_loc": ["When Sleight of Fist connects with %min_enemies_for_double_sleight% or more enemies, the enemy closest to Ember Spirit will be attacked a second time. Damage for the second attack is reduced by %second_attack_damage_penalty%%%."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "mana_costs", "old": [75], "new": [60]}, {"field": "AbilityManaCost", "old": {"base": [75], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [60], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "attack_effectiveness", "old": null, "new": {"base": [80], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "08b04ef5fe40952b5225", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e5f428aec77bbdc85e37", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "1413f3da722ec8548211", "mechanism": "bash", "mechanism_zh": "重击", "definition": "攻击或技能造成重击（眩晕目标）；有概率、固定攻击次数或技能触发都算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "db2645a86c40081385ee", "mechanism": "cleave", "mechanism_zh": "分裂溅射", "definition": "攻击伤害波及周围单位", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "ac31853e5f8b2ad5bedd", "mechanism": "critical", "mechanism_zh": "暴击", "definition": "攻击造成额外倍数伤害；有概率触发或强化下一次攻击都算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:ember_spirit_sleight_of_fist:invulnerable_untargetable:base", "mechanism": "invulnerable_untargetable", "mechanism_zh": "无敌/不可选取", "definition": "暂时无法被伤害或无法被指向", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "209106ee9d873a98041d", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:ember_spirit_sleight_of_fist:terrain_walk:base", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "enchantress_enchant", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·魅惑", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Enchantress charms an enemy. If the enemy is a hero, they are dispelled and slowed for %slow_duration%s, and Enchantress and her units gain bonus attack range against the target. If the enemy is a creep, she brings it under her control and receives %xp_gain_pct%%% of their experience bounty. Enchantress can control creeps for up to %dominate_duration%s. DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Illusions can be converted."], "scepter_loc": "Enchantress can control multiple creeps at a time.", "facets_loc": ["Cast Range of Enchant is increased. If the enemy is a hero, Enchantress and units she controls have increased attack range against the target."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Enchantress charms an enemy. If the enemy is a hero, they are dispelled and slowed for %slow_duration%s, and Enchantress and her units gain bonus attack range against the target. If the enemy is a creep, she brings it under her control and receives %xp_gain_pct%%% of their experience bounty. Enchantress can control creeps for up to %dominate_duration%s. DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Illusions can be converted."], "scepter_loc": "Enchantress can control multiple creeps at a time."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "dominate_duration", "old": {"base": [30, 60, 90, 120], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [45, 70, 95, 120], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "enchant_health", "old": {"base": [150, 250, 350, 450], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [175, 250, 325, 400], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "a7d3c2935a4cc9507c6b", "mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "mechanism_zh": "施加弱驱散", "definition": "移除目标身上可被弱驱散的效果", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "31aa49f6713aeab572bf", "mechanism": "economy", "mechanism_zh": "经济经验", "definition": "提供额外金钱或经验；只是正常赏金不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "61882e5da9145eef51f9", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "283710ee47807de4c17f", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "fcf1c4a714e71df7a7f5", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "enigma_black_hole", "name_zh": "谜团·黑洞", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "CHANNELED - Summons a vortex that sucks in nearby enemy units. Enemies affected by Black Hole cannot move, attack, or cast spells.", "scepter_loc": "Black Hole deals additional damage equivalent to %scepter_pct_damage%%% of the unit's Max Health per second and does a non-interrupting pull towards it in a %scepter_radius% AoE. Pulls at a rate of %scepter_drag_speed%."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "CHANNELED - Summons a vortex that sucks in nearby enemy units. Enemies affected by Black Hole cannot move, attack, or cast spells.", "scepter_loc": "Black Hole deals additional damage equivalent to %scepter_pct_damage%%% of the unit's Max Health per second and does a non-interrupting pull towards it in a %scepter_radius% AoE. Pulls at a rate of %scepter_drag_speed%."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "damage", "old": {"base": [100, 150, 200], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [90, 135, 180], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "31437ac1940494fa9184", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d8066069c01639f06e44", "mechanism": "channel_interrupt", "mechanism_zh": "打断持续施法", "definition": "说明明确写打断持续施法；眩晕、沉默等已有控制不重复记", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "5b4e4b531192f8215f79", "mechanism": "channeled", "mechanism_zh": "持续施法", "definition": "施法者自身需要持续引导，被打断即停止", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "40d6a0938c5d81ec2187", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "scepter_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:enigma_black_hole:displace_other:base", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:enigma_black_hole:ground_zone:base", "mechanism": "ground_zone", "mechanism_zh": "场地魔法", "definition": "在地面某个位置留下一块持续一段时间的作用区域，单位留在其中就持续受影响（如寒冰之墙、臭云、烟幕）；区域跟着单位走的归光环，瞬间生效一次的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:enigma_black_hole:stun:base", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a690d8b579491aa8c7f8", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "enigma_demonic_conversion", "name_zh": "谜团·恶魔召唤", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Summons three fragments of Enigma himself at the cost of health. The eidolons health is increased by %current_health_pct%%% of Enigma's current health. These eidolons are all under Enigma's control, and repeated successful attacks cause them to multiply. When this happens, the eidolons have their health restored."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Summons three fragments of Enigma himself at the cost of health. The eidolons health is increased by %current_health_pct%%% of Enigma's current health. These eidolons are all under Enigma's control, and repeated successful attacks cause them to multiply. When this happens, the eidolons have their health restored."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "eidelon_base_damage", "old": {"base": [16, 28, 40, 52], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [15, 27, 39, 51], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "eidolon_damage_spread", "old": {"base": [4], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [3], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "8e7e4fdd00dbc02732c5", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "9848a57eb10f3087f9d7", "mechanism": "cleave", "mechanism_zh": "分裂溅射", "definition": "攻击伤害波及周围单位", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "5e691771eec250500009", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "enigma_malefice", "name_zh": "谜团·憎恶", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Focuses Enigma's power on a target, causing it to take damage and become repeatedly stunned for multiple instances. An instance strikes every %tick_rate% seconds.", "shard_loc": "Increases Malefice stun duration by %shard_bonus_stun_duration_tooltip%s and creates an Eidolon next to the target every instance of Malefice stun. These Eidolons will not multiply further."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Focuses Enigma's power on a target, causing it to take damage and become repeatedly stunned for multiple instances. An instance strikes every %tick_rate% seconds.", "shard_loc": "Increases Malefice stun duration by %shard_bonus_stun_duration_tooltip%s and creates an Eidolon next to enemy Hero targets every instance of Malefice stun. These Eidolons will not multiply further."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "12a696b34c480e56e190", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "6d077ae2a11d4f6b19f3", "mechanism": "cleave", "mechanism_zh": "分裂溅射", "definition": "攻击伤害波及周围单位", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "948d246833ab62d6d1b2", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:enigma_malefice:summons:shard", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "a247b64952b1613bc0b9", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "essence_distiller", "name_zh": "精之灵器", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Soul Release Provides %soul_heal_amount% health regeneration when cast on allies. Can be ground targeted to lie dormant for up to %ground_duration%s and attach to the first enemy that comes within %latch_range% radius. When on enemies, deals %soul_damage_amount% damage per second and provides True Sight over them and shares their vision with the wearer's team. Lasts %duration% seconds. Gains charges every time an enemy hero dies within %soul_radius% units.", "notes_loc": ["Empty distillers gain 2 charges.", "Only the closest Essence Distiller to the dying hero will gain a charge.", "If the allied unit is attacked by an enemy hero or Roshan, the effect is lost.", "Does not trigger spell block or spell reflect.", "While dormant, provides vision in %latch_vision% radius. Vision lingers for %linger_after_latch_duration%s after latching."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Soul Release Provides %soul_heal_amount% health regeneration when cast on allies. Can be ground targeted to lie dormant for up to %ground_duration%s and attach to the first enemy that comes within %latch_range% radius. When on enemies, deals %soul_damage_amount% damage per second and provides True Sight over them and shares their vision with the wearer's team. Lasts %duration% seconds. Gains charges every time an enemy hero dies within %soul_radius% units.", "notes_loc": ["Empty distillers gain 2 charges.", "Only the closest Essence Distiller to the dying hero will gain a charge.", "If the allied unit is attacked by an enemy hero or Roshan, the effect is lost.", "Does not trigger spell block or spell reflect.", "While dormant, provides vision in %latch_vision% radius. Vision lingers for %linger_after_latch_duration%s after latching."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cast_ranges", "old": [1000], "new": [850]}, {"field": "AbilityCastRange", "old": {"base": [1000], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [850], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "50fc76af06c5ea77aa28", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "6511e3ff0d64871e1188", "mechanism": "charges", "mechanism_zh": "充能", "definition": "技能或物品用一次消耗一点；只决定数值或层数的不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "39394784377e94844011", "mechanism": "grant_vision", "mechanism_zh": "提供视野", "definition": "提供目标或区域的视野", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "cd915fd6db53b408a271", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "16b61ac9c149864cccde", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d92d22de1d1aed13ef71", "mechanism": "spell_block", "mechanism_zh": "格挡指向技能", "definition": "使指向自身或队友的技能失效", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "a9711e16debc8161560a", "mechanism": "spell_reflect", "mechanism_zh": "反弹指向技能", "definition": "把指向技能反弹给施法者", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "eb982ca17aacf26ada14", "mechanism": "true_sight", "mechanism_zh": "真视", "definition": "可看见隐身单位", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "ethereal_blade", "name_zh": "虚灵之刃", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Ether Blast Converts the target unit to ethereal form, rendering them immune to physical damage, but unable to attack and %ethereal_damage_bonus%%% more vulnerable to magic damage. Enemy targets are also slowed by %blast_movement_slow%%%, and take %blast_stat_multiplier%x the sum of all your attributes + %blast_damage_base% as magical damage. Duration: %duration% seconds", "notes_loc": ["Shares cooldown with Ghost Scepter and its upgrades.", "Ethereal units take %ethereal_damage_bonus%%% bonus magic damage."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Ether Blast Converts the target unit to ethereal form, rendering them immune to physical damage, but unable to attack and %ethereal_damage_bonus%%% more vulnerable to magic damage. Enemy targets are also slowed by %blast_movement_slow%%%, and take %blast_stat_multiplier%x the sum of all your attributes + %blast_damage_base% as magical damage. Duration: %duration% seconds", "notes_loc": ["Shares cooldown with Ghost Scepter and its upgrades.", "Ethereal units take %ethereal_damage_bonus%%% bonus magic damage."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [22], "new": [20]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [22], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_agility", "old": {"base": [24], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_intellect", "old": {"base": [24], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_strength", "old": {"base": [24], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "a773a8b7a337d4275011", "mechanism": "ethereal", "mechanism_zh": "虚无", "definition": "单位进入虚无状态：无法攻击，也不会受到物理攻击；魔法和纯粹伤害仍可作用", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e86c2b50255c1ad8979b", "mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减魔抗/魔法易伤", "definition": "降低目标魔抗，或让目标受到更多魔法或技能伤害", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "da63ecb9663cdcdea499", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "faceless_void_chronosphere", "name_zh": "虚空假面·时间结界", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Creates a blister in spacetime, trapping all units caught in its sphere of influence and causes you to move very quickly inside it. Only Faceless Void and any units he controls are unaffected. Invisible enemies in the sphere will be revealed.", "notes_loc": ["Pauses all units and buildings, friendly or enemy, except those owned by Faceless Void.", "Faceless Void is never affected by Chronospheres with any owner."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Creates a blister in spacetime, trapping all units caught in its sphere of influence and causes you to move very quickly inside it. Only Faceless Void and any units he controls are unaffected. Invisible enemies in the sphere will be revealed.", "notes_loc": ["Pauses all units and buildings, friendly or enemy, except those owned by Faceless Void.", "Faceless Void is never affected by Chronospheres with any owner."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:faceless_void_chronosphere:ground_zone:base", "mechanism": "ground_zone", "mechanism_zh": "场地魔法", "definition": "在地面某个位置留下一块持续一段时间的作用区域，单位留在其中就持续受影响（如寒冰之墙、臭云、烟幕）；区域跟着单位走的归光环，瞬间生效一次的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "1c7abb938228523fc949", "mechanism": "reveal", "mechanism_zh": "显形", "definition": "使隐身单位显形，不等于持续真视", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:faceless_void_chronosphere:stun:base", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "faceless_void_time_dilation", "name_zh": "虚空假面·时间膨胀", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Faceless Void envelops nearby enemies with time dilating fields to slow cooldown progression of their abilities. Each enveloped enemy gains one Time Dilation stack when applied, and one stack per ability they have on cooldown. Each stack deals damage per second and slows movement and attack speed. The duration is paused while affected by Chronosphere.", "notes_loc": ["Does not affect item cooldowns.", "Number of stacks can change during the effect. Casting an ability will provide a stack if it goes on cooldown. If an ability cooldown ends during Time Dilation, a stack will be removed."], "shard_loc": "Increases slow per stack. Provides Faceless Void with stacks that increase his attack and movement speed. Amount of stacks is equal to the total amount of Time Dilation stacks applied to enemies at the moment of the cast and linearly fades out over the duration."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Faceless Void envelops nearby enemies with time dilating fields to slow cooldown progression of their abilities. Each enveloped enemy gains one Time Dilation stack when applied, and one stack per ability they have on cooldown. Each stack deals damage per second and slows movement and attack speed. The duration is paused while affected by Chronosphere.", "notes_loc": ["Does not affect item cooldowns.", "Number of stacks can change during the effect. Casting an ability will provide a stack if it goes on cooldown. If an ability cooldown ends during Time Dilation, a stack will be removed."], "shard_loc": "Increases slow per stack. Provides Faceless Void with stacks that increase his attack and movement speed. Amount of stacks is equal to the total amount of Time Dilation stacks applied to enemies at the moment of the cast and linearly fades out over the duration."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [28, 24, 20, 16], "new": [24, 21, 18, 15]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [28, 24, 20, 16], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [24, 21, 18, 15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "attack_slow", "old": null, "new": {"base": [4, 5, 6, 7], "scepter": null, "shard": [13]}}, {"field": "attack_slow_tooltip_only", "old": {"base": [4, 5, 6, 7], "scepter": null, "shard": [5]}, "new": null}, {"field": "damage_per_stack", "old": {"base": [4, 6, 8, 10], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [6, 8, 10, 12], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "duration", "old": {"base": [7, 8, 9, 10], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [6, 7, 8, 9], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "self_attackspeed_tooltip", "old": {"base": [0], "scepter": null, "shard": [9, 10, 11, 12]}, "new": {"base": [0], "scepter": null, "shard": [17, 18, 19, 20]}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:faceless_void_time_dilation:aoe_damage:base", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:faceless_void_time_dilation:attack_slow:base", "mechanism": "attack_slow", "mechanism_zh": "减攻速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的攻击速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "ecf43041929141ab3503", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d4e042c2a903cd1ec45d", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "force_staff", "name_zh": "原力法杖", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Force Pushes any target unit %push_length% units in the direction it is facing.", "notes_loc": ["Self-cast will cause you to use Force on yourself.", "Force Staff doesn't interrupt the target's actions.", "Will not work on a unit inside Chronosphere, Duel, or Black Hole.", "Force Staff has %enemy_cast_range% cast range when cast on enemies."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Force Pushes any target unit %push_length% units in the direction it is facing.", "notes_loc": ["Force Staff doesn't interrupt the target's actions.", "Will not work on a unit inside Chronosphere, Duel, or Black Hole.", "Force Staff has %enemy_cast_range% cast range when cast on enemies."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "5221fe038e1e4bb245fd", "mechanism": "channel_interrupt", "mechanism_zh": "打断持续施法", "definition": "说明明确写打断持续施法；眩晕、沉默等已有控制不重复记", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "f593d5325706dcaa094b", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:force_staff:self_mobility:item", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:force_staff:terrain_walk:item", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "furion_curse_of_the_forest", "name_zh": "自然先知·青森诅咒", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Applies a curse on all enemy heroes within %range% range, displaying them in fog, slowing them, and dealing damage over time based on the number of trees within %radius% radius. Treants count as trees for this purpose."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Nature's Prophet and his treants curse enemies they attack, slowing them and dealing damage per second. Curses from different attackers stack. Each attacker's curse has an independent duration that can be refreshed by further attacks from the same unit that applied it."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "behavior", "old": "8589934597", "new": "8589934595"}, {"field": "target_type", "old": 1, "new": 19}, {"field": "cast_points", "old": [0.2], "new": [0]}, {"field": "cooldowns", "old": [18], "new": [0]}, {"field": "mana_costs", "old": [80], "new": [0]}, {"field": "AbilityCastPoint", "old": {"base": [0.2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [18], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "AbilityManaCost", "old": {"base": [80], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "damage_per_second", "old": null, "new": {"base": [24], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "damage_per_tree", "old": {"base": [15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "duration", "old": {"base": [7], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "radius", "old": {"base": [250], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "range", "old": {"base": [900], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "slow", "old": null, "new": {"base": [10], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "slow_per_tree", "old": {"base": [7], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "treant_damage_per_second", "old": null, "new": {"base": [12], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "treant_slow", "old": null, "new": {"base": [5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "121fb347dd76a7845730", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:furion_curse_of_the_forest:grant_vision:shard", "mechanism": "grant_vision", "mechanism_zh": "提供视野", "definition": "提供目标或区域的视野", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d7dd1518385fcfeb6689", "mechanism": "reveal", "mechanism_zh": "显形", "definition": "使隐身单位显形，不等于持续真视", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "6cdc27068b4e055d0dcb", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "furion_force_of_nature", "name_zh": "自然先知·自然的呼唤", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Converts an area of trees into Treants under the command of Nature's Prophet.", "notes_loc": ["Nature's Call can only create as many treants as there are trees in the target area."], "facets_loc": ["Summons a reduced number of stronger Treants with reinforced damage."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Converts an area of trees into Treants under the command of Nature's Prophet.", "notes_loc": ["Nature's Call can only create as many treants as there are trees in the target area."], "facets_loc": ["Summons a reduced number of stronger Treants with reinforced damage."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "treant_armor", "old": null, "new": {"base": [1, 2, 3, 4], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "treant_bonus_hero_damage", "old": {"base": [6, 10, 14, 18], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [5, 10, 15, 20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "treant_damage", "old": {"base": [16, 25, 34, 43], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [15, 25, 35, 45], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "treant_health", "old": {"base": [450], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [425, 450, 475, 500], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:furion_force_of_nature:summons:base", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "furion_spirit_of_the_forest", "name_zh": "自然先知·丛林之魂", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Nature's Prophet gains %damage_per_tree_pct%%% bonus damage for each nearby tree. Treants also provide this bonus with multiplied values regardless of proximity. Treants also possess this ability.", "notes_loc": ["Treants gain bonuses from trees and other treants around them.", "Treant Protector does not provide any bonuses."], "facets_loc": ["Treant multiplier increased."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Nature's Prophet's attacks gain %damage_per_tree_pct%%% bonus base damage for each tree near the target, including Sprout trees. Treants near the target also provide this bonus with multiplied values. Treants also possess this ability.", "notes_loc": ["Treants gain bonuses from trees and other treants around their target.", "Treant Protector does not provide any bonuses."], "facets_loc": ["Treant multiplier increased."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "1bf7e178dac25ecbd837", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "46ed94bac292f78e1c5a", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "furion_sprout", "name_zh": "自然先知·发芽", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Sprouts a ring of trees around a unit, damaging and trapping it in place and providing vision in a %vision_range% radius.", "notes_loc": ["Sprout can be cast on any unit, or the ground.", "Trees created by Sprout have the same interactions with abilities as regular trees."], "facets_loc": ["After Sprout is cast, all trees in a %healing_radius% radius emit an aura that heals nearby allies. Allied Tangos provide double the heal duration when consuming a tree created by Sprout."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Sprouts a ring of trees around a unit, damaging and trapping it in place and providing vision in a %vision_range% radius.", "notes_loc": ["Sprout can be cast on any unit, or the ground.", "Trees created by Sprout have the same interactions with abilities as regular trees."], "facets_loc": ["After Sprout is cast, all trees in a %healing_radius% radius emit an aura that heals nearby allies. Allied Tangos provide double the heal duration when consuming a tree created by Sprout."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "sprout_damage", "old": {"base": [70, 130, 190, 250], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [70, 140, 210, 280], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "6ca734fac136de2cca3a", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "b649f22596a67cd0c9a9", "mechanism": "grant_vision", "mechanism_zh": "提供视野", "definition": "提供目标或区域的视野", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:furion_sprout:mobility_lock:base", "mechanism": "terrain", "mechanism_zh": "创造地形", "definition": "在地上造出单位不能穿过的地形，无视地形的单位能越过", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "be0d95543a57660db386", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "furion_teleportation", "name_zh": "自然先知·传送", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Teleports to any point on the map. Gains a barrier after arriving to its destination.", "notes_loc": ["Mana and cooldown take effect when the cast is completed. Nature's Prophet will not use any mana or waste the cooldown if the spe